  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Actual per-box frame-width sums determine endpoint physical borders, not shared indices. Native integer midpoint and strict half-overlap union/majority conditions determine selection.",
    "Column search uses upper endpoint interval above the first endpoint, union in endpoint rows and lower endpoint interval below the last endpoint unless native half-width rule combines them.",
    "Original endpoints stay retained, unmatched endpoint result stays partial and output is deduplicated original box order. Row search keeps all original row boxes.",
    "Actual cursor rings and mounted menu selected-box painting edit original cells through native character attributes/history; no TextRuns or row-width side map introduced."
  ],
  "residuals": [
    "Merged/nested/row-spanned/protected cell graph/selection and full VCL/layout selection remain unrepresented.",
    "Native unequal-edge column insertion still rejects different selected row indices or row box counts; no insertion promotion from this selection leaf.",
    "Complete selection cursor layout/enhanced-table state and width item pooling remain partial.",
    "Registered IO/open/save/recovery/settings remain byte-identical; no full module/upstream parity promotion."
  ]
}
